# SchemaSpy output is generated, ~21 MB, and fully reproducible from
# generate/ (see SOP.md step 3). Regenerate locally when you need the
# exhaustive per-table reference; do not commit it.
schemaspy/

# Local scratch from the PDF export step.
_print.html
_p.html
_d.html
schema.json

# The repo-root .gitignore excludes *.sql (aimed at database dumps). These three
# are SOURCE, not dumps — they derive the in-scope tables, export the schema, and
# compute the drift fingerprint. The SOP is unusable without them, so un-ignore
# them here (a deeper .gitignore overrides a shallower one).
!generate/*.sql
